sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as Employee / AI client
    participant Entra as Microsoft Entra ID
    participant Gateway as Gateway + policy
    participant Identity as AgentCore Identity
    participant Runtime as Delegated Runtime
    participant Graph as Graph / SharePoint
    Note over User,Graph: Target design - live validation required
    User->>Entra: Employee sign-in - request Gateway access
    Entra-->>User: Token A - for Gateway
    User->>Gateway: Request with Token A
    Note over Gateway: Validate caller and authorize operation
    Gateway->>Identity: OBO exchange for Runtime access
    Identity->>Entra: Request token preserving employee identity
    Entra-->>Identity: Token B - for delegated Runtime
    Identity-->>Gateway: Token B
    Gateway->>Runtime: Approved request with Token B
    Note over Runtime: Validate Runtime token and trusted ingress
    Runtime->>Identity: OBO exchange for Microsoft Graph access
    Identity->>Entra: Request Graph token preserving employee identity
    Entra-->>Identity: Token C - for Microsoft Graph
    Identity-->>Runtime: Token C
    Runtime->>Graph: Execute operation with Token C
    Note over Graph: Enforce employee permissions
    Graph-->>Runtime: Result or denial
    Runtime-->>Gateway: Bounded response
    Gateway-->>User: Result or failure
